      "id": "20fcb9eb-e0a5-4e65-b07e-4131cce462a9",
      "name": "PreProcess Suggestions"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 🗂️ Chat Question Suggestions (with persistence)\n\n### Purpose\nGenerate and cache 2–3 high-signal executive questions for a book, returning them instantly on repeat requests.\n\n### How it works\n- Accepts a `book_id` via webhook  \n- Loads the book (title + summary) from Supabase  \n- Checks for existing chat suggestions for that book  \n  - **If found** → returns them immediately  \n  - **If missing** → asks an AI agent to generate new questions  \n- Parses the AI response into individual questions  \n- Persists the questions to Supabase for future requests  \n- Responds with a single `output` field containing a JSON-encoded array of strings (LLM-friendly format)\n\n### Why this exists\n- Keeps chat UIs fast and deterministic  \n- Avoids regenerating suggestions on every page load  \n- Ensures consistent, high-quality starter questions per book  \n\n",
        "height": 512,
        "width": 768,
        "color": 4
      },
